# Cloudflare credentials for scripts/deploy-with-env.sh. Copy to .env.deploy (gitignored).
# Only these are read at deploy time: the console's own settings come from the per-deployment
# app-config.json passed with --config, never from env vars.
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID is required with --env: the script stops unless the token reaches it
# (`wrangler whoami --json`).
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
